      "cooked": "<p>Sooo seeing how you guys are riding the “no ones done a hero based coop  card game before” any chane we could get more stuff in the same universe? Like say a “dungeon crawl” where either every one plays against the villain which is handled by a deck and die or the game set up or where one person plays the villain and has his objective and the other/s play the heroes?</p>\n<p>Or to put the whole paragraph into one word… MOAR!!!</p>",
