      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/5e9695/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-09-01T15:00:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Is there any way those of us who are looking forward to the expansions can pay in advance for them so we can support you guys right now? My friends I’ve introduced to the game really wanna get at these expansions, and so would I. I’d be totally cool with just sending you guys the money now. Or would that just be useless because you’d still have to print and send me the expansion? Seriously, you guys at &gt;G are pretty cool, and I’d be up for donating. Or, I remember in one of the threads that you mentioned getting a Kick Start for &gt;G. Again, you could do that and I’m sure some of us will donate to the cause. You all deserve it for taking a shot at something new.</p>",
