      "id": 22112,
      "name": "Christopher",
      "username": "Christopher",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-09-01T19:28:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The Kickstarter would probably not be up for at least a few more weeks, but it <span class=\"bbcode-b\">will</span> happen this fall, so you don’t have long to wait!</p>\n<p>I have to say, thank you so much to all of you.  All of your support really means a lot to us.  It makes us feel like this game we love so much and had so much fun making is just as much fun to other people.  We’re doing this for the love of the game, and we’re just floored by all of the positive responses we’ve been getting.  So, thank you.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:56:10.395Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
