      "id": 22120,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-09-08T17:36:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We are thrilled by all of the excitement that Sentinels has generated.  I’m working on the Kickstarter <em>right now</em>, and I’m excited to get it finished.  It will be full of fabulous prizes for people who are interested in donating.  Here is a very brief sneak peek of some highlights:</p>\n<p>[list]<br>\n[<em>]Get the expansion weeks before it is released![/</em>]<br>\n[<em>]Get play mats and other gameplay accessories available nowhere else![/</em>]<br>\n[<em>]Get your likeness on a card![/</em>]<br>\n[<em>]Get a one-of-a-kind hand-crafted hardwood chest for storing SotM and future expansions![/</em>][/list]</p>",
      "post_number": 14,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:56:10.866Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
