      "user_title": "Chief Justice",
      "title_is_group": false,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "We are thrilled by all of the excitement that Sentinels has generated.  I'm working on the Kickstarter *right now*, and I'm excited to get it finished.  It will be full of fabulous prizes for people who are interested in donating.  Here is a very brief sneak peek of some highlights:\n[list]\n[*]Get the expansion weeks before it is released![/*]\n[*]Get play mats and other gameplay accessories available nowhere else![/*]\n[*]Get your likeness on a card![/*]\n[*]Get a one-of-a-kind hand-crafted hardwood chest for storing SotM and future expansions![/*][/list]",
