      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/58956e/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-09-08T20:24:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Paul&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Paul\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We are thrilled by all of the excitement that Sentinels has generated.  I’m working on the Kickstarter <em>right now</em>, and I’m excited to get it finished.  It will be full of fabulous prizes for people who are interested in donating.  Here is a very brief sneak peek of some highlights:</p>\n<p>[list]<br>\n[<em>]Get the expansion weeks before it is released![/</em>]<br>\n[<em>]Get play mats and other gameplay accessories available nowhere else![/</em>]<br>\n[<em>]Get your likeness on a card![/</em>]<br>\n[<em>]Get a one-of-a-kind hand-crafted hardwood chest for storing SotM and future expansions![/</em>][/list]</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Awesome!!! I am so down for this, I will be contributing as soon as it is made available. By far this has been the most played game, of those that I acquired at GenCon this year, by my group. It is always the first to be picked to be played and we can’t wait for the expansion. Keep uyp the good work guys and hopefully we can help out with playtesting the next one.</p>",
